{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': '1608299775', 'answerTime': 'Feb 9, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423468800, 'question': "My wife's english is ok, but her grammar is what needs work. Will this help?", 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. This is not good for grammar. It was the same case for my wife, so we have to google grammar lessons to understand how a particular sentence is built. This software teaches you what objects are called in english and basic sentence formation. But it does not tell you "why and how" this sentence is built this way.'}
