{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': '1617160407', 'answerTime': 'Dec 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417852800, 'question': 'Does the program help with becoming fluent to carry a conversation with locals? Beyond simply phrases?', 'answer': 'Absolutely....but, you must seek to be as immersed in the language and culture as much as possible. Listen to music, news in Italian (RAI), watch movies and turn off the subtitles, go to Italian restaurants. The program is a lot of fun and I highly recommend it. But, like with all language learning, you must be intense and purposeful. Ciao!'}
