{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': '1617168718', 'answerTime': 'Dec 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1420012800, 'question': 'Is there anything apart from the lesson 1-5 set I need to purchase for the course to work? In other words are their fees for on-line access, and is that needed?', 'answer': 'Chuck, I do not know. My knowledge of Chinese is dialect heavy(Beijing, Sichuan and Cantonese) and I used it for standardizing my speech to the norm for speaking formally with people. The on-line is for continuing your learning and picking up on vocabulary for any special needs that you might have.'}
