{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00005LBVU', 'answerTime': 'Jul 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373871600, 'question': 'Will this game or some version of it run on an Intel based Mac? The PowerPC processer was dropped from support by Apple with the release of 10.6.', 'answer': "No it will not. I tried everything. But I can't get this to work for my brother. Sadly, I'd say skip this version and write to the developers to get this classic back into working circulation!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00005LBVU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1360915200, 'question': "I can't get the game to install on Mac OS X 10.8.2, though my son could install it on OS X 10.6? What can I do to get it installed on 10.8.2?", 'answer': "OSX 10.5 (Tiger) was the last operating system to support PowerPC-based software, and that is what this game is. I don't believe there's any way to get it to run on 10.8 (Mountain Lion) unless the developer releases an updated version. It's a bummer."}
