{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00005MOTG', 'answerTime': 'Jun 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404025200, 'question': 'As of today April 14, 2014, Microsoft has already stopped its support for WinXP, can I still activate the software if I buy this version?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. A Microsoft spokesperson stated that "Windows XP can still be installed and activated after end of support on April 8[, 2014]".'}
