{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002Z9TGO', 'answerTime': 'Jun 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401692400, 'question': 'I just received my Lotus millennium disk and for some reason it does not load due to a "error accessing system registry"? Troubleshoot for Win7Prof', 'answer': "When you insert the disc the dialog box is displayed and one of the choices is to run the set up. Don't run set up from this dialog box. Close the the dialog box and open Windows Explorer and locate the CD drive. Find the Set up exe file on the CD and double click on it. This should run the set up."}
