{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0006I74UK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395990000, 'question': 'What is the difference between this and the "Professional" version? Is it worth paying almost triple the cost for the Pro version of this same software?', 'answer': 'The pro version has the machine option; and a library of some patterns (Donna Vermillion Giampa; Kooler Design Studio). If you are a regular stitcher (rather than a teacher or a designer), the regular program will do everything you want! mb'}
