{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0009G037A', 'answerTime': 'Jul 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406012400, 'question': 'I cannot get my works suite 2006 to install on my new computer with Windows 7. Can someone help. I really like the Digital Image software', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'If your software is ok then I suggest you talk to a professional. I use Staples where I live. I have always had good luck with them and they are very fair on pricing. Secondly, I would check to see if the drivers can be installed manually. But again, if you have the resources I would talk to someone you trust.'}
