{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000AP89JE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411628400, 'question': "Can this version run on Windows 7? I see that it only lists for Win XP. I don't need it to be more sophisticated, so if it runs on Win 7, I'm happy.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, I use it with Win 7. The only problem I have is that it sometimes doesn\'t open properly. I\'ll click on the icon, and it will act like it is opening, but the program doesn\'t appear. I just open Task Manager and close the Photoshop program, and then reopen it. I have noticed that if I open a graphic file by telling it to "Open With... Photoshop", it always seems to work fine.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000AP89JE', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428390000, 'question': 'Can this version install and run on Windows 8?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, Adobe Photoshop Elements 4.0 will install and run on Windows 8 computer. I have the program and have been using it for several years. You will receive warnings about incompatibility, but these can be ignored. All the features that you want and need work properly.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000AP89JE', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428390000, 'question': 'Can this version install and run on Windows 8?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I'm not completely sure, but I don't think it will work with Windows 8. Win 8 is a new system, where Win 7 was just an update from XP and Vista."}
