{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000BQXTSS', 'answerTime': 'Oct 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413356400, 'question': 'how many disks are there? Can I just install Pages? Do not need the other programs and do not want to waste HD space.', 'answer': 'It only comes with the install disc. The box also has the getting started guides & serial number card in it so it makes the box look larger. You can install only the programs you need. I only needed it for Keynote, so I only installed that. You can do the same for the other programs as well. Hope this helps :)'}
