{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000BQXTSS', 'answerTime': 'Jul 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406185200, 'question': 'Will this work on PowerPC Macs? Such as the PowerBook G4 12 in. If not, can you tell me a version that will work?', 'answer': 'This will work on your powermac. I currently have mine uploaded onto a G4 400 mhz tower. The only app that wont work is iMovie. It requires a G5.'}
