{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000BS2V30', 'answerTime': 'Aug 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377068400, 'question': 'Will it work with my NUVI 2455 LMT, and do I need to buy an adapter for the SD card?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It comes with the SD adapter (and Garmin people told me it works with any Garmin that'd taking it). But it worked terribly on our trip to Spain in July. Do not recommend, emphatically. Cost us about $500 in fuel and $$$$ in anxiety. I saw cab drivers using Tomtom there, not Garmin."}
