{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000HKMQ64', 'answerTime': 'Jun 16, 2012', 'unixTime': 1339830000, 'question': 'Will this product work with Windows 7? Will this product work with Windows 7?', 'answer': 'It works fine on Windows 7; inserting the disc just opens a PDF file that allows you to browse the various other PDF files (organized by decade of publication). Most computers already have Adobe Reader installed for reading PDF files. If you do not, you can always get the latest version for free at http://get.adobe.com/reader/.'}
