{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000MN8R5A', 'answerTime': 'Mar 4, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425456000, 'question': 'What year is the version I will be receiving on DVD?', 'answer': "I'm not sure I understand the question, but let me answer it this way. You will want to make sure that you get the latest version of this software that Garmin has published, and it will not be easy to tell in advance if that is what the vendor will sell you. If you want to make sure, order it directly from Garmin, or contact the vendor directly before ordering to make sure that they intend to send you the correct version. Since I have been caught before, also make sure that the seller is an authorized vendor of Garmin products. Some companies, e.g., Sony, will not honor a warranty or give you a free upgrade if you did not purchase the product originally from one of their authorized retailers. I am not sure if Garmin has a similar policy, but it might be worth checking before you buy. If I didn't answer your question, try again."}
