{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000OL5IFC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392883200, 'question': 'Can you run these through a printer?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "Based on the texture of these cards I would strongly caution against doing this. Plus, because these are meant to be worked on in various mediums, such as water colors and pencils, the ink from your printer will likely feather out into the fibers of the notecards and not give you crisp lines, which is likely what you're looking for. Hope this helps."}
