{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000W3RSGE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 23, 2008', 'unixTime': 1206255600, 'question': 'Can TurboTax 2007 be used for Non-resident ? I bought TurboxTax 2007 Deluxe, but I cannot find the forms 1040NR or 1040NR-EZ for non-resident. what shall I do now?', 'answer': 'TurboTax does not support the forms for non-resident filers. Return the product for a full refund. Bob Meighan VP, TurboTax'}
