{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001AMPP0W', 'answerTime': 'Aug 31, 2009', 'unixTime': 1251702000, 'question': "Can I use it (Snow Leopard family) on my mac and my sisters' across the street? Is it possible to use the Family pack on her Mac as well?", 'answer': 'We asked Apple if we could install our family pack on my parent\'s computer (in Los Angeles), on my brother\'s (in downtown L.A.), and on my wife\'s, family\'s, and my computer: a total of six computers. It doesn\'t hurt to ask: the Apple representative said, "No problem. We\'re just glad you enjoy our product. We really aren\'t concerned with that."'}
