{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001EJVQDG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 1, 2010', 'unixTime': 1262332800, 'question': 'Can this product combine two pictures (not HDR combine)', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Most definitely yes. I have been using this program for years, and I have even brought it to work and showed it to my boss... we now have 6 licensed copies at work for doing that very thing. I use this program mainly for taking parts of photos and combining them with other photos to create graphics to fill our customers' requests. Each element you use can be placed on a separate layer to be blended and edited independently from the other elements. It is very easy to do, and you can enhance your creations with plug in filters that are designed for Photo Shop. (Yes, PS filters work in PSP). Alien Skin has some excellent filters and you can download demos of them to try out."}
