{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001EUBSL0', 'answerTime': 'Dec 8, 2009', 'unixTime': 1260259200, 'question': 'cs4 compatible with windows 7? Does anyone know if CS4 will work on Windows 7?', 'answer': 'My experience is that it will not install on my computer after I upgraded to Windows 7 Professional 64 bit. My copy of Photoshop CS4 Extended had worked OK on both Windows XP and Vista64bit prior to my purchase of Win7. If interested, see my review posted under the full retail version of this product.'}
