{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GBZALQ', 'answerTime': 'Apr 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397977200, 'question': 'Hey Fluenz, what if I guy Italian 1+2 and then want 3,4,5? Can I buy just those as a set/addon, or to I have to buy 1-5 to complete it?', 'answer': "Hi Eric, After ordering Italian 1+2, you can purchase the user upgrade for levels 3+4+5 directly through us. When you're ready to move onto those levels, just let us know and we can provide further help. - Fluenz User Support"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GBZALQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 29, 2009', 'unixTime': 1262073600, 'question': 'Florenz levels: Do I need both levels or just level 1?', 'answer': "I think you wanna get them both - italian isn't an easy language to learn and after going through both of the levels you will have a very basic Italian knowledge. pretty much enough to get by while traveling."}
