{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001L8L3L0', 'answerTime': 'Jul 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404975600, 'question': 'Can I use this with Elements 11? It is the only software I have.', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "The specific software that is associated with this question is no longer available. If you're looking at a used copy or something, it only works with Adobe Lightroom and Apple Aperture. However, the current version of this software, not available through Amazon, as far as I can tell, can be purchased through Google. https://www.google.com/nikcollection/ The updated software works with Aperture, Photoshop, Photoshop Elements, and other products. I would save your money, not buy this version, and purchase the modern one that will do what you want, and probably work a lot better."}
