{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PIAUEW', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421827200, 'question': 'Can SiteSpinner Pro be used to work with my site that I developed using Adobe Dreamweaver CS2?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Harry - I am pretty sure the answer is no to that one. If you are able to use DreamWeaver, SiteSpinner probably wouldn't be powerful enough. It is really meant for non-techie people like me! Steve"}
