{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PKTDMU', 'answerTime': 'Dec 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386489600, 'question': 'Will it work with my Nuvi255W, if not can I return it?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It will work only if the device was preloaded with the map for that corresponding part of the world, not if it was on a SD card. The other thing that may work is the GARMIN dvd with life time update. I had to return my key since I was not able to install the update (original with life timeNorth America map preloaded, Europe on a one time SD card) The lifetime Europe update would not install. I had to call Garmin to confirm this.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001PKTDMU', 'answerTime': 'Dec 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387785600, 'question': 'will this work with a nuvi 50lm and is it on a micro sdcard?', 'answer': "Yes this update will work on your device. You need to resister the device on Garmin.com. Don't forget you still need to buy the European Maps for this update to work. Below is the link to the Micro SD card I bought on amazon. It will work on your device. http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00200K1TS/ref=oh_details_o08_s00_i00?ie=UTF8&psc=1"}
