{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001UHMVKO', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425024000, 'question': 'How engaging would this be for a 14 year old boy who gets bored easily?', 'answer': 'This is a great program for anyone who wants to learn how to type. Bought this program for the family and our teenage son is now a wiz typing on his desktop and laptop computer. He now types around 60-70 wpm. My wife uses the program also just to keep up her speed. She loves it. Good luck.'}
