{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002IYLIC0', 'answerTime': 'Oct 31, 2011', 'unixTime': 1320044400, 'question': 'Is this the same product that Sage sells directly? Is this Act!', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'There are 2 versions of ACT! The Pro version is for 1-10 users who do not need to sync. The Premium version is for 10+ workgroups or for those who need to work remotely and sync to a main network database.'}
