{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002J1UJ4A', 'answerTime': 'Jun 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403938800, 'question': "If I'm buying this used, will I be able to install? Or do I need a new registration key?", 'answer': 'That depends entirely on the seller and Apple, you can do some basic research into the (history of this software) used software is usually supported however in this case, the product is EOL, (end of life) it is not supported by Apple and development stopped on this version of the software, some time ago, (it still functions quite nicely, however just be aware that over time these types of products do degrade)'}
