{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002KINDD6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2010', 'unixTime': 1262851200, 'question': 'using 2007 quicken.deluxe; is 2010 deluxe same or do I have to upgrade to Premier? using 2007 quicken.deluxe; is 2010 deluxe same or do I have to upgrade to Premier?', 'answer': 'I had the same question. In a Quicken chat with a representative I was quaranteed that I lose none of the 2007 Deluxe investment tools if I purchase 2010 Deluxe version.'}
