{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002KINDD6', 'answerTime': 'Apr 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397458800, 'question': 'My "Deposit" column disappeared on the Register screen. How do I get it back?', 'answer': 'Hope This Helps!, I previously had 2010 but now I am using 2014 edition so I am not sure if I will be of help. In 2014 in the same row that your "Deposit" would normally appear see if there is a "gear" clear on the right side. Click on the gear and if it is the same as 2014 it will give you check boxes of "payment", "amount", "deposit", etc. I don\'t think that you have a glitch I think that somewhere if not what I suggested you will find a "view" that will include the "deposit". Good luck. Larry'}
