{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002LLFAKG', 'answerTime': 'Dec 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386921600, 'question': 'Is this software able to teach left handed players? Can you see the chord diagrams, fret board, illustrations in left handed view?', 'answer': "I checked it out for youl. On the main screen it shows right handed chords. So does the chord dictionary. BUT the fretboard can be displayed at anytime and it has a left handed view, that shows how each chord would be played from that position. So, it would be a bit more messing around for you than me to get going on it, because you'd have to compare it to the left handed fretboard, but very doable. Hope that helps you!"}
