{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002Q2TTIO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373785200, 'question': 'What is the expected data use for downloading a North American map update?', 'answer': "Not quite clear on what you mean. Essentially the update is supposed to give you new info that wasn't included in the previous data, like new streets or some that were previously excluded. One problem I have found is, that when trying to update maps, the system does not allow it, and Garmin will NOT answer when queried about it. VERY disappointing and to my thinking fraudulent (as it prevents me from getting my money's worth.)"}
