{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SRNS7A', 'answerTime': 'Jan 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388908800, 'question': 'Will this make a recovery image on a BluRay disc?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I'm sorry that I can't provide an answer for you. I have abandoned Norton Ghost. Although Symantec usually has great products like Norton 360 and Norton Security Suite, I can't say the same for Ghost. I have had nothing but trouble with it and have switched my backup program to Acronis 2013. Acronis is also not the easiest to manage, particularly when a recovery becomes necessary. However, I found it to be better that Ghost even though Acronis is seriously deficient in documentation. Hope this helps."}
