{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZF31NQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393401600, 'question': 'Can this be used on more then 1 computer? Have been thinking about buying a new laptop in the fall.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You can use it on up to three. And you can always de authorize it on all and reset it. So if you had it on three computers, de authorize it and sign in on the computers you want it on.'}
