{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0030MUKI2', 'answerTime': 'Feb 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392019200, 'question': 'does it read the any PDF music sheets? i have a lots of music sheets and i want a software that could read it, thank u for the help', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Sorry, Mohammed - I am having a bear of a time just trying to get my Encore 5.0.2 to work properly (you have to exit the file and re-enter in order to edit mistakes, as if it forgot what it was doing right while you were working on a very delicate musical passage. It\'s a very nice program otherwise, but seems to be quite self-contained. A quick perusal of "Help" and "Open File As..." mentions nothing about PDF. Nor is there a Converter. The last posts I have seen when I Google "GVOX" or "Encore 5.0.2" are from around 2011. Tell you the truth, there are a lot of questions I would like to ask them.'}
