{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00310UXQW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370674800, 'question': 'Is this recommended for kids (6 years old)', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't have a kid, but this program doesn't seem very kid friendly to me. It requires a lot of spelling, like spelling out the word/phrase/sentence you hear. So, my best answer would be no, but maybe someone with children would know better."}
