{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00337D8U6', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1364281200, 'question': 'is it compatible with windows xp?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes it is compatible with windows XP, which by the way I believe was one of Windows Best running systems, I have Windows 8 on one of my computers and really do not care for it ! I am running this current version of Microsoft Office on Windows 7 and Love it !'}
