{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00337D8U6', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386230400, 'question': 'if i need to reinstall it on my computer and i have used up all three instatlations will it allow me to do it', 'answer': 'Yes, but first you need to "uninstall" the installation on the computer you don\'t need or want to have it on, and then you install on your new computer. That\'s what I did when my old laptop was going out on me - before it died completely - and installed on my desktop instead. If I would have NOT been able to uninstall it before my laptop died, maybe I would have had to call Microsoft tech support. Then when you first use the program, it asks you to unlock it. Just input the key (that amazon keeps on file for you so you never lose it) and it works perfectly!'}
