{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0036Z0NW6', 'answerTime': 'Dec 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419494400, 'question': '2pc/1user what does this mean?', 'answer': "It means you can install the software on up to two computers that connect through the same internet provider. In other words they must be in the same household. You can't share with a friend."}
