{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0039L50ZC', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355731200, 'question': 'Will Visio Standard 2010 work with templates that were created in Visio 2003?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The older versions seem to work quite well. You have to move some Shapes to the new version and you can download shapes. Otherwise old files work well.'}
