{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0039L31P8', 'answerTime': 'Oct 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412319600, 'question': 'How do I reinstall Office 2010 if my computer crashed and I have the Key Card', 'answer': "Reinstall using the same key card but if it doesn't work you'll have to call them."}
