{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0039L31P8', 'answerTime': 'Jun 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403074800, 'question': 'Do I get the the Office License', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes you get a licence for one PC'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0039L31P8', 'answerTime': 'Jun 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402729200, 'question': 'once i purchase the key card how do i downoad the software. or is there any posibility to get the disk itself. pls help as I have windows8surfacepro', 'answer': "There's instructions on the box on how to download a backup copy. However, I think you're doing yourself a disservice by purchasing the old version. 2013 is designed around touch. You could also consider purchasing a subscription to Office. The Office 365 Home Premium subscription for $99/year has most of the same programs and lets you install on up to 5 devices."}
