{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0039L31P8', 'answerTime': 'Mar 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395990000, 'question': 'If I get a new computer can I take it off this one and Install it on the new one or do I have to buy a new card every time I buy a new computer?', 'answer': 'I believe you can only re-install to the same computer, but if it is uninstall first then installed to your new PC it should work. If you make an image of your old PC first, you may be able to load back if your new install is not accepted. I plan to try this,but not now.'}
