{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0039L2XG6', 'answerTime': 'Aug 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376722800, 'question': 'I installed it on my computer. Now I would like to activate it. I have a starter version of Excel installed. Do I have to delete the starter version?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No, you do not have to delete the starter version. Just follow the one-screen prompts & input your key-codes to activate. First thing after that, immediately go to Windows Update and download all the current patches, etc. You should have no problems.'}
