{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003B32B0U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1358582400, 'question': 'What is the minimum Mac OS required for CS5?', 'answer': 'The minimum Mac OS required to run Adobe Photoshop CS5 is OS X 10.5.7. A multicore Intel processor is required. The complete list of system requirements is available from Adobe: http://helpx.adobe.com/x-productkb/policy-pricing/system-requirements-photoshop.html However - if you have 10.6.8 (minimum) and the cash for the application, I have found CS6 to be a very worthy upgrade.'}
