{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003D1606G', 'answerTime': 'Jul 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405407600, 'question': "I currently use Expressions Web 2.0 but it doesn't work in the Google Chrome browser. Does Expression Studio 4 Web Professional address this problem?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I have not seen any issues with the Chrome browser and Studio 4 code. However, the sites I've created do not use any microsoft-specific technology such as asp. If you are creating a site that adheres to html and CSS standards and does not use proprietary technology, then it should work in all browsers. Let me know if you need more info."}
