{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003NVHWO0', 'answerTime': 'May 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400655600, 'question': 'Will this work with an iPad and an acoustic piano?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "No, it won't run on an iPad. The product description says it supports Windows and Mac only. Not only does the iPad have a different operating system (iOS vs. Windows & Mac OSX), it has a completely different hardware architecture (ARM vs. Intel x86). So even if you could find a way to copy the software to the iPad, it just won't run."}
