{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003Y68OKU', 'answerTime': 'Jun 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371193200, 'question': 'will this work for W7 to W8 too?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Stuart. I used one of Laplink's 'PCMover' programs to upgrade from Vista to Win7; it worked really well and was simple to use.There is a PDF guide which you can download and print out; this takes you step by step through the upgrade process. Laplink's support team headed by Ray Pettit is excellent; you can chat online for help if needed. This link will advise you which program is most suitable : http://www.laplink.com/index.php/individuals/pcmover-for-windows-8/feature-overview Regards Bob."}
