{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003YCOJAS', 'answerTime': 'Oct 14, 2010', 'unixTime': 1287039600, 'question': 'Will Outlook for Mac calendar work on iPhone? Anyone else trying to do this too?', 'answer': "I'd suggest using BusyCal. You can try a trial version and see if you like it and if it suits your purpose. I use it and love it. It's like iCal on steroids. It also keeps all of my calendar information synced with Google and from there back down to my iPhone. If I edit anything through BusyCal, Google or my iPhone, it automatically updates to the other two areas."}
