{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003YUBS2C', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385971200, 'question': 'Can I connect my own digital camera with this? Or do I have to use the supplied dog-cam?', 'answer': 'Depends on your camera. But most digital cameras will connects I have used it with my Logitech webcam, a Panasonic DV camcorder and a JVC camcorder. All connected without problem using both USB and Firewire connections.'}
