{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003ZTRIW6', 'answerTime': 'Dec 15, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355558400, 'question': 'Is this age appropriate for an 11 year old girl?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "This would be a lot for most 11-year-old girls to master unless they have someone who can teach them. In fact, many adults have this software for months and still cannot master it. There is a kids' version called Flip Boom, that is much cheaper and could maybe be a good starting place. I think you might be able to upgrade from Flip Boom to Studio later on as well...You could check the website to confirm."}
