{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041DTNI2', 'answerTime': 'Apr 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398150000, 'question': 'Will it open files of older versions of FTM? (2003)', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You can download your files to it, and it will convert them to the new format. Be sure to do a back-up file of what you have on 2003 before you download 2011. Then on 2011 you\'ll do an "import" of your back-up files.'}
