{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043T6LHA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 25, 2011', 'unixTime': 1295942400, 'question': 'Turbo Tax Deluxe...e-file costs?? I see on Turbo Tax Deluxe that you get a free Federal E-file, but do you get a free state e-file as well?', 'answer': 'We always use the TurboTax Deluxe Federal + e-File + State. Last year we paid $19.95 to e-file our State Taxes. Federal was included on CD.'}
