{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0045BAJKQ', 'answerTime': 'Jun 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370847600, 'question': 'amazon says i bought a lifetime license. Yet when I try to clean files, it says: I have to buy a license. What gives?', 'answer': 'Tell him to click on "your account" and scroll down to "your games and software library" -clean my mac should be listed there with its product key information which he will need to plug in somewhere or he can just download the whole item again. Good luck.'}
