{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0045BAJKQ', 'answerTime': 'Mar 19, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426748400, 'question': 'Hi, I got a question: I Have a mac book pro 13" with a OS X Yosemite version 10.10.2. This software (clean my mac) can be use in my OS x Version ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No..not CleanMyMac classic u will need CleanMyMac 2 (and soon to be released 3) on that MAC model OS. But get it! U will love it!!! It is the best automated cleaner for MAC out there!!! I am a puter pro and I recommend it to ALL my MAC customers!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0045BAJKQ', 'answerTime': 'Oct 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414393200, 'question': 'will clean my mac classic work on an older mac?? the newer clean my mac software was not compatible with my mac.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, the older version of "Clean my Mac" will work with older versions of Mac OS. I have used it successfully.'}
