{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0048NUNY8', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390291200, 'question': "Is this software only good for upgrade purposes - OR - it's a startup kit to get my business going? I already have all the hardware needed.", 'answer': 'Good afternoon, thank you for your interest in QuickBooks Point of Sale Basic. This particular item is an upgrade from an older version to the most current version of QuickBooks Point of Sale. If you do not have a prior version search Amazon for: QuickBooks Point of Sale Pro 2013 New User it will take you to the listing for the new user software. Peter Customer Relations Manager'}
