{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004A7Y0UK', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2011', 'unixTime': 1296288000, 'question': 'H&amp;R Block Deluxe + state +efile: Is only $18.99 on ebay for downloaded version.', 'answer': "Amazon's prices like any retail store are not written in stone, even for downloadable stuff. $26.99 was a great deal for me since I haven't paid that low for the CD version for a few years now. If you can beat it on ebay, and the downloadable version there is safe, then stop stalling, get it now. Just make sure it's what you want (fed and state combined I assume is what you want)."}
