{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004A7Y0UK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2011', 'unixTime': 1298707200, 'question': 'How many computers? Anybody know if you can install on multiple computers?', 'answer': 'Although I rarely did before, the copies I bought on CD from earlier this decade would yes. If you are using the downloadable copy, just save the file on a flash drive.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004A7Y0UK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 4, 2011', 'unixTime': 1296806400, 'question': "Why doesn't this software come with State efile capabilities?", 'answer': 'Because not everyone needs it. I live in Florida and we have no State Income Tax.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004A7Y0UK', 'answerTime': 'Apr 9, 2011', 'unixTime': 1302332400, 'question': 'H&amp;R Block Key Code? I downloaded the H&amp;R Block home deluxe that says it comes with 5 free e-files but it tells me I need a key code?', 'answer': 'I called Amazon about this exact issue (HR Block closed at 8 p.m. EST -- on April 9, no less!) The product key is under your account, in my games and software section. When you click on your software, it will have a button that says product code that you can click on for the key code. At least Amazon.com has people staffing their help section past 8 p.m.!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CRNACW', 'answerTime': 'Apr 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397804400, 'question': 'If I buy Fluenz from Amazon is it going to support MacOSX 10.9.2 (Mavericks) and what about the new updates from Apple?', 'answer': 'Yes you will get the latest version that is Mavericks compatible, just make sure that it says "sold by Fluenz" at the checkout to ensure you are getting the most recent version. We also do provide users with updates for future Apple updates as well. Cheers, Andy - Fluenz User Support'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CRNACW', 'answerTime': 'Oct 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382079600, 'question': 'How many computers can this product run on? If there are two people in the house who will be studying together, do we have to buy two copies?', 'answer': 'No, this is why I love Fluenz and purchased instead of Rosetta Stobe. I have Fluenz installed on all 3 of mycomputers. Plus, they have the full program online which you can access from any computer even if not installed. They give you a login for that website when you purchase the program. They are extremely customer focused and responsive if you call or email with questions. I researched extensively between Fluenz and Rosetta, and read about what a nightmare Rosetta is in terms of their licensing. I finally purchase Fluenz a couple years ago and have never regretted it.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CRNACW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418198400, 'question': 'Does it come with a microphone? If not, what type has been found to be the easiest to use with the program?', 'answer': "No, the program doesn't come with a microphone. I am using a Logitech h540 headset/microphone which is not much money at best buy."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004CRNACW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370070000, 'question': 'Does this product, Fluenz French 1-5, work on a MAC OSX 10.6.8 operating system?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'According to the system requirements posted on their website it supports "OS X 10.5 and above, including Mountain Lion" http://fluenz.com/support/system-requirements/'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CRNACW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427698800, 'question': 'What kinds of books or textual material come with the course?', 'answer': 'Hi John, The Fluenz program is 100% digital. Everything that you need is built into the lessons. There are also additional features such as the Fluenz Online, Flashcards, and the iPad/Android Phone/iPhone Apps. Cheers, Fluenz'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CRNACW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427698800, 'question': "My mother bought this for me as a Christmas gift and I don't have/see the activation code anywhere in the box. No email with it either?? help", 'answer': "We'd be happy to help. Can you please send us the order number or the full name of the person who purchased the program to help us locate that serial number. Once we have that we should be able to help further, bye for now."}
