{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004GB1YO0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 22, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427007600, 'question': 'Do you have to deactivate it on one computer to the reactivate it on another?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "My version of Final Draft 8, which I bought two years ago, allows the purchaser to install the program on two computers simultaneously. To put it on a third computer, you must take it off one of the others. I don't remember the exact procedure, but I recall that it's outlined in Final Draft's website. If not, I did find the guy on their tech support line helpful."}
