{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004I45BLW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403247600, 'question': "Can you add notes to ingredients or are you confined to a pick list that you can't edit? Example: 1/4 cup Parmesan (but I use 1/3 cup)", 'answer': 'Yes. Once you have imported a recipe, you can change it or annotate it. If you type in your own recipe, you can put in whatever information you want.'}
