{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004Q0PT3I', 'answerTime': 'Mar 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1364367600, 'question': 'Can I install this on my Windows XP computer and make it WIndows 7? How much space does it use? THanks!', 'answer': "Hi Really depends on the age of your machine. This version is for system builders, meaning you'd have to wipe windows xp and install win7 fresh. This won't upgrade an existing windows installation. If your machine is older than 4 years, I'd suggest a new machine. The install took 15gb of my hard disk"}
