{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Q0T10A', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'Will it update VISTA?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "As I read it, after I got it is NO. It will not update anything unless, you completely format your hard drive, since it is for new computers, and not an upgrade. That is what I wanted and when I got this I couldn't even understand what I was supposed to do. You have to buy another program to get ready to install this one. So my answer would be no upgrade for any operating system. I wanted it for XP, but have a Vista too, NADA, as I read it. I sent it back and Amazon is amazing in handling returns. Thanks Amazon............."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004Q0T10A', 'answerTime': 'Oct 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381820400, 'question': 'i have a ibm thinkpad with a partial install (failed) can i wpe and install as a clean drive or do i have to have a system to work off of.', 'answer': 'I have installed Windows on hard drives that were brand new and just had the original factory formatting. Once started in the CDROM drive Windows would check the new drive for formatting, format if necessary, and then proceed to install itself on the new drive.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Q0T10A', 'answerTime': 'Mar 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395990000, 'question': 'Can I install win7 home premium over win 8, which hate', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'This is new install so it wipes any other OS and ALL FILES that you have previously loaded. Be sure to backup your files first and have the media to reinstall the programs or apps that you run.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Q0T10A', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396854000, 'question': 'Will I be able to do Microsoft Word?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes There Is A version For Windows 7 Probably Available For Download If You Do Not Have It Already'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Q0PTD8', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382425200, 'question': 'can i replace windows 8 basics with windows 7 professional on my desktop help', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, I hated Win 8 that came with my laptop. I bought Win 7 Ultimate on Amazon, took the laptop to a local computer house and had them wipe Win 8 and install Win 7. Been using it ever since. Win 8 is not suitable for a mostly business computer. It is for tablets.'}
