{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004Q0PTD8', 'answerTime': 'Jun 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402038000, 'question': "I'm about to buy my first gaming PC and I can't decide between Windows 8.1 or Windows 7 Ultimate, which works better?", 'answer': 'I love my Windows7Ultimate64 but I am OLD SCHOOL!, They say Windows8.1 has less FAT and more slimlined interactivity. Windows7 has good support for now but will end some day. Windows 8.1 will take some getting use to. I would go with Windows7 but as I said I AM OLD SCHOOL'}
