{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004Q0T0LU', 'answerTime': 'Nov 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384848000, 'question': 'I have both a laptop and a desktop. If I wish to buy Windows 7 can I download one of the Windows 7 products for both PCs, or do I need to purchase 2 Windows 7 products? CTH', 'answer': 'You need 2 separate keys, so will need 2 copies. I had the same challenge, but since this is oem it is only 1 license for 1 pc.'}
