{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00532UT7Y', 'answerTime': 'Apr 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397286000, 'question': 'I do not have MS office on my computer. Does the key card work for initial installation on my computer?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes it does. Unfortunately Microsoft has moved their download website for Office 2010 and the one on the box is invalid with no forwarding to the new one. Go to the Microsoft website and search on "Office 2010 Backup". It will direct you to a site where you can enter your Program Key and download the program. The download takes about 45 minutes with high speed internet. It will also give you the option to purchase the DVD/CD\'s for about $13.'}
