{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0055XNWJI', 'answerTime': 'Apr 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397458800, 'question': 'can it be put on computer', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It depends on the version. The version I have is the micro SD card version. It cannot be put on a computer but the chip can be moved from one device to another. Other versions may be used with the MapSource program for transferring maps to a device, but are tied to a specific device.'}
