{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0055XNWJI', 'answerTime': 'Sep 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379055600, 'question': 'Does it cover Ireland?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I have used it only in France and now I'm in the US, but when I scrawl into Ireland and zoom on Dublin, I can see a map with all street names and places of interest. If I do the same for Tel Aviv for example I get no street map. So I would say with confidence that this card covers Ireland fully."}
