{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005BE71LG', 'answerTime': 'Sep 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410332400, 'question': 'this product "Symantec Endpoin 12.1" was published in 2011, is it still a valid version of Symantec?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, we bought it two months ago after doing a chat with Symantec from their site and asking them if there is a newer version. It is the current version and was a much better price from Amazon than direct from Symantec. I'm not loving this product due to some poor tech support issues, but it mostly works and is current."}
