{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005DM5QEK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386316800, 'question': 'I only have windows 2003 software. will this program work with that dated of software?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Hi Cassie-Writeway Professional Edition will work with Windows XP, Vista & 7. Must have 512 MB RAM 40 MB disk space. XP is really old (enlarged memory) but I really like it. So, I kept XP. WPE works well for me on it. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005DM5QEK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385971200, 'question': 'my computer only has windows 2003 software. Is that too old for this to work?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi, Christopher. I'm not sure what you mean by Windows 2003 software. There is no Windows 2003. Probably you have either Windows Vista or Windows DP. I just checked the WriteWay website and they say the WriteWay runs on the following Windows 32/64-bit versions Windows XP, Windows Vista, and Windows 7 and Windows 8. You need to check which version of Windows you have. If it's Vista or XP, the website says it will work. Check for yourself at http://www.writewaypro.com/product_info.php. Hope this helps. Good luck."}
