{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005EJ2PFK', 'answerTime': 'Sep 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378105200, 'question': 'Does it include ESET Mobile Security for android?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, the ESET Family Security Pack with 5 licenses allow you to use it on 5 different computers in addition to a combination of 5 android devices (tablets and smartphones). Therefore, it's actually like getting 10 licenses with this purchase. The description on amazon doesn't say this, but if you go on ESETs website you can view the full details. I purchased this family pack here on amazon recently, and I'm successfully using it on 5 computers, 2 smartphones and 2 tablets without any issues. Hope this helps."}
