{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005HTIWJ0', 'answerTime': 'Aug 6, 2012', 'unixTime': 1344236400, 'question': 'Will Corel VSPX4 allow me to import/edit .MTS files?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes. You will also be able to export your HD video to DVD media using AVCHD format. The files can be played directly on to your Blu-ray player. Or, you can export to DVD, but the files will not be HD, because DVD players do not support HD. There are other export choices as well, but I find that putting HD video directly into a Blu-Ray readable format is convenient.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005IHW242', 'answerTime': 'Oct 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412146800, 'question': 'Is this software good to write a business plan for a Hotel construction and also for a non-profit organization?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The software is a canned software. I have found it to be useful but you must know accounting and you must know about the companies goals for a business plan.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005IHW242', 'answerTime': 'Dec 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417939200, 'question': 'Would this be helpful for writing a business plan for an internet startup seeking venture capitalists?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Absolutely not. This program is buggy and hard to use. If you want a cookie-cutter business plan, this is for you though. You would really have to have growth potential for venture capitalists to even take notice of you. You are much better off doing lots of research by looking at other business plans than buying this. This does not provide the detail you would need for something like that. If you're starting an internet start up, you had better learn to code and show people how something works, not just theory. Additionally, by writing your own business plan after thorough research you will know your company that much better and be able to pitch it with greater success."}
