{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005QSBQEK', 'answerTime': 'Oct 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381215600, 'question': 'will this load older version files', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi - wasn't sure, still not positive. Went back and found some greeting cards from 2009, using version 20, and they worked OK, others did not. But I've been using one form or another of 23 for many years and going strong. Sorry I can't be more helpful. Also should mention that I have a copy of my old Windows XP virtual installed (when I bought this PC which used Windows 7) just so my Print 23 would work. It works on both."}
