{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005QSBQEK', 'answerTime': 'Nov 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384243200, 'question': 'is there a way you can reverse writing to do iron-on transfers', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't know about doing reverse writing, but Print Shop 23 has transfers available in it's project picker. After you finish your project and choose print it will automatically reverse the print for iron on transfers. Hope this helps."}
