{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006WODYUQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417420800, 'question': 'Do you need to have a CD drive on your computer to install this or is this program available for download?', 'answer': "I believe you need to install the CD in order to set yourself up with an acct with Fluenz. After the setup of the acct you will have access to the lessons online and on iPod/iPhone/iPad app.However if you would like to contact Fluenz Support you can by emailing usersupport@fluenz.com. The reps will be happy to answer your questions. They are very quick to respond and very friendly. Good luck! You'll love the program if you decide to get it."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006WODYUQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412060400, 'question': 'Can this software be used on a computer (say a work computer) without installing files/software? I would not be able to install it at work.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You can activate the program on up to 3 personal computers. You have the ability to either run from the disc, or install to hard drive.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006WODYUQ', 'answerTime': 'Aug 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407999600, 'question': 'Can I use this program on multiple computers?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Katherine, if memory serves I believe the license is for up to three (3) different computers. They also have an iPhone app now that is very convenient though you will need either wifi or a cellular signal to access the content on your phone.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006WODYUQ', 'answerTime': 'Aug 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407481200, 'question': 'Is there an app for using the program on Android phones, or is only available for Iphones?', 'answer': "Hi Randy, We understand that Android is a priority and we're working hard on developing the app. Please bear in mind that because Android Apps have to support so many different devices it takes work to get it right. We're aiming to have the Android App out to you before the end of the year and hopefully sooner."}
