{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006WVR9GY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385971200, 'question': 'Is there a framing and background program?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'There is a plugin for AfterShot Pro that you can download and install called "zFrame". According to its description this plug-in draws up to five frames around an image. Each frame can be set with different size and color. I haven\'t used it so I can say how well it works or how robust it is. From just the description it seems to have limited capabilities, especially when compared against the Framing feature in PaintShop Pro. I don\'t know what you mean by a "background program" so I can\'t address that part of your question.'}
