{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007H083NC', 'answerTime': 'May 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399446000, 'question': 'what is the functional difference of the acedmic version versus the personal version?', 'answer': "You may get a better price. I know that in other products like Micrsoft, if you're a student or in education, you get a 10% discount for software and hardware. You can contact the vendor directly."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007H083NC', 'answerTime': 'Jan 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389254400, 'question': 'does it come with a disc?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I am certain you can purchase this product with a CD -- but I prefer the downloadable versions, so no disk --- just download the application and install it. I taught myself how to use it pretty fast. I really like this project --- far better than MS Paint. Once installed, all you have to do is click on the "Print Screen" and the Snagit Tool opens and you can capture whatever you want.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007H083NC', 'answerTime': 'Oct 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381388400, 'question': '1 or 2 licenses?', 'answer': '1 license.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007H083NC', 'answerTime': 'Aug 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376290800, 'question': 'Does this product work with both windows and MAC?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Have no idea about it working with a Mac --- but it fouled my Windows7 OS to the point where I was ready to put my PC in the recycle bin Took me three days to figure out the conflict ---- and, when I did and deleted all traces of Snagit 11, my PC was perfect again. As I said, I have no idea about Mac compatibility. Good luck!'}
