{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007H083NC', 'answerTime': 'Apr 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398754800, 'question': 'Can SnagIt capture text and let me edit it', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'SnagIt cannot capture the actual letters in the text. It can capture a screen print of the text. If you could copy the actual text, you could also paste it into a SnagIt text box and edit it (but if you can do that, you can already paste it anywhere and edit it). So the short answer is, no.'}
