{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007IWCWFE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381906800, 'question': 'Can you use this as an upgrade if I have CorelDraw Graphics SuiteX3?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'My X6 box says you need to have X4 or X5. Sometimes you can call Corel and they can help you upgrade with a later version. Or find a cheap X4 and then go on from there. I did that for Painter.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007IWCWFE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391068800, 'question': 'I have use photoshop in the past to creative black and white drawings of metal sign designs. Would I be able to do this with product?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'When my husband and I had our website, we used Corel Draw Graphics Suite exclusively. I was able to design signs, stationery, business cards, etc. I recommend it highly. It is a true high end software, and worth every penny.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007IWCWFE', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385971200, 'question': 'I have the X4 full version. Can I buy this X6 Suite Upgrade? Or I must have el X5 version to buy this upgrade?', 'answer': "As long as you have a version of Corel installed on your computer, you can upgrade. it doesn't matter if the versions are in sequence."}
