{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007PNZ2S0', 'answerTime': 'Sep 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411282800, 'question': 'Hi, Please I need to know if the Sibelius First program for window, will work perfect with my Oasys 88 keyboard and play back my song and printer to?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "The program works with any MIDI keyboard, so as long as there are MIDI ports on your keyboard, just buy a cable and you'll be good to go. And of course Sibelius will play back and print your music."}
