{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007R0RKPO', 'answerTime': 'Jun 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401951600, 'question': "I bought Adobe Photoshop CS6 PC for my Win 7 last year, but I'm thinking to move on to Macbook. Do I have to buy another Adobe Photoshop CS6 Mac?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'When you bought this version you made a decision for the window system. You need a mac version. You may be able to deactivate your win version and request a mac version. Ask Adobe Photoshop Support Center under Help at top right menue bar. Hope this helps - good luck. Wernerl'}
