{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007SOLCP8', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389168000, 'question': "I started to download this last week. It also started downloading stuff I didn't want...games, changed my internet search engine, etc. How can I avoid this happening? Thank you.", 'answer': "Chances are the companies asked you if you wanted their services and you probably didn't notice. When downloading programs off the internet, be careful of the small writing when asking to proceed. Sometimes they will have these programs pre-checked for you and you have to uncheck them in order to not receive their games/search engines. Otherwise, you need to go and delete them manually off your computer."}
