{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007UM59O8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397631600, 'question': 'Where can one see a complete list of the "over 60 file types" advertised one can "work with"? Corel.com doesn\'t provide one.', 'answer': 'Interesting question, Harper. The list comes up when one tries to use the "save as" feature inside WP, but I don\'t see a way to copy that list for you. Among the "60 file types," there are many versions of Word, some old versions of WP, WordStar, Quattro Pro, and many many more. If you have a particular program in mind that you want to use with WP, I\'d be glad to check the list for you. Otherwise, maybe someone else will know how to give you the whole list. Sorry...'}
