{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'Jul 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373612400, 'question': 'Does this course require statistic background?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I would say that 3 of the 5 days covered by this course assume familiarity with statistics beyond, say, normal distribution parameters such as mean and standard deviation - if that is a guide. It helps if you understand what a T-test is used for, or when you would apply the Poisson distribution. You will still get value from the course without having had a lot of statistics training, but if you want to be a data scientist, you will need a very solid grounding in statistics to get the most from this course. I also suggest you review the open source R statistics package before starting this course.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'May 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1368428400, 'question': 'Does this product allow real lab access or just view the lab demos? If the latter, what are the options for simulating the actual lab environment?', 'answer': "In addition to the narrated video recording of each lab exercise, a zipped file of the labs' source code and applicable datasets are provided on the DVD. This zipped file can be found in the Resources section on the Course Menu tab. As stated in an earlier response to this question, you will have to download and install free and open source tools such as R and RStudio. Since you may plan to use these tools after the completing the course, it makes sense to install the latest versions of the software tools directly on your machine. Kate Hutchinson, EMC Education Services"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'Jan 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1358409600, 'question': 'Does this training DVD also include the $200 Voucher to take the EMC Proven Professional Data Science Associate (EMCDSA) Certification Exam?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'The VILT does not include the voucher for taking the EMCDSA Certification Exam, however, you can purchase the Exam Voucher through Pearson VUE here: http://www.pearsonvue.com/emc/ Kate Hutchinson EMC Education Services'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361433600, 'question': 'How many hours of video instruction does this have?', 'answer': 'There are 25 hours of actual video lecture, but the course itself is designed to take 40 hours when including the data sets/exercises included on the DVD. Kate Hutchinson EMC Education Services'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361433600, 'question': 'I would like to buy this but I am in Australia. Can you provide me a way to purchase this and mail it to my Australiahn address? Thanks, averzosa', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'I relayed your question to our fulfillment team and we are currently working on making international shipping available for this product. We are capable of shipping internationally from our internal site, so you can order this title from http://education.emc.com. Best regards, Kate Hutchinson EMC Education Services'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'Aug 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1375772400, 'question': 'Two questions: (1) How often will this course be revised? (2) How many people have passed the exam and obtained EMCDSA certification to date? Thanks.', 'answer': 'EMC Education Services periodically reviews its materials to ensure the content is still current. As of July 2013, there are over 200 individuals who have achieved the EMCDSA certification. --Kate Hutchinson, EMC Education Services'}
