{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X5FSHK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419321600, 'question': 'Has there been any updates to this course recently? Many people have complained about the labs not working? Also, is this good enough for the EMCDSA?', 'answer': "Labs are only for the classroom based courses. They don't provide lab access to the online version. I asked couple of times and they didn't accept. Totally agree without the labs the content is not enough. I have done R labs in my own PC, but others don't work."}
