{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008DBTVY4', 'answerTime': 'Oct 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414393200, 'question': 'user reviews for Readiris 14 were 5 star. Prms installing? While it may be a prm to install-I didnt see it with my HP disc. Rate its usage?', 'answer': 'I suppose it depends upon what you are using it for. The connection with a HP printer is through its own software not the HP disc at least in my case. My HP printer and software sometimes does the same thing in terms of scanning except in the case of Readris 14 the scan can be to MS Word which is editable and more importantly to me, used by my translating software to translate scanned foreign languages into English. My HP printers are on local networks and for some reason the software gets changed via HP upgrades. A short while ago Readris 14 stopped working right. A recent upgrade to it plus a recent upgrade to HP got it going again. A coincidence? Maybe even the Windows 7 upgrades have something to do with it. Hopes any of this helps.'}
