{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008H4PTVQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': 'I have a Dell 64 bit windows 7, It will install up ot a pont and then it says, no assigned driver, it ask for driver to be installed .is that the boot', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'There are two methods you can recover from here, you can restore to a previous point under the start up menu when you are starting you machine, or, if you made a recovery disk when you started your machine the fist time that is your best bet. The recovery disk will contain the missing file. If you do not have that contact Dell and see if they can ship a recovery disk, the last thing is to do as I did and buy one from Amazon. I have been able to restore several machines in this manner. I hope this helps.'}
