{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008MR29YI', 'answerTime': 'Oct 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382770800, 'question': 'Will this compress doubler-layer DVDs to a single-layer DVD?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'yes, it can compress double layer DVDs to fit single layer 5gb DVDs, but the program can only do one task a time, and is very slow. Even it says it duplicates in 30 minutes, it is far from that. On average it takes about 3 hours to make one copy, and it does not offer to store in hard drive after copy is done.'}
