{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008MR2IDK', 'answerTime': 'Aug 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377414000, 'question': 'how do i uninstall kaspersky internet security 2013', 'answer': "Just Like most internet security programs the quickest way is to go to Google or Bing and search Kaspersky uninstall tool. The uninstall tool will remove it completely. With all security programs just search for uninstall tool and it will remove it. Make sure its from the official site of the product you uninstall. BE Careful not to go to a site you don't know just incase its a virus. So the Kaspersky site is were the removal tool is found. Just like Symantec is the place you go for the Norton removal tool. Hope this helps."}
