{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008NP76AQ', 'answerTime': 'Mar 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395903600, 'question': "Can this be used to transcribe from older (1987) audio tapes to text?. Obviously one cannot 'train' the software. Help please.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Interesting question... If it is your voice that has been trained on Dragon and it's your voice on the old audio tapes, I would think yes! If not, you could try it; as my daughter picked up my headset once and her voice transcribed pretty well without being trained. You may want to call : 1-888-831-0088 ask for Mike"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008NP76CE', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387267200, 'question': 'Does Dragon recognize just one voice or can anyone in the household use it?', 'answer': 'Anyone can use it but for optimal use, each user should create a user profile and allow Dragon to train using his or her voice.'}
