{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008NP76CE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1362038400, 'question': 'As a student was wondering if my 5 year old MIC that did not work well with Windows 8 speech recognition (not sure if it was OS/Mic) work with this?', 'answer': "Probably not. However, when we ordered Dragon, a headset was included in the box, so you shouldn't need to worry about your existing headset."}
