{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008NP76G0', 'answerTime': 'Oct 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381042800, 'question': 'what are the properties of this item?', 'answer': 'It is a dictation software, you "speak" to it through a line or USB microphone and the software types your spoken words in a word processer software, most commonly MS Word. This particular version is for Spanish. I do translations from English into Spanish and I can tell you it is a very import part of my gear, it slashes by more than half the time it would otherwise take me to translate audio and/or books. Hope this helps!!!'}
