{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008RA5FIC', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1359446400, 'question': "How can the quickbooks contractor version help me. i'm a home improvement contractor", 'answer': 'The most important advantage of the contractor edition is that it supports the concept of estimates and invoices. You can create an estimate to give to a client, then update the estimate, and QB will track the line-items added. Then eventually when the job is done, you can make an invoice from the estimate. Not just useful for contractors, but also useful for auto repair or any business that is required to produce estimates before an invoice.'}
