{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008RA5A00', 'answerTime': 'Jan 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1357372800, 'question': 'Does this version of Quicken work with Windows 8? I have not been able to get Quickbooks to work on windows 8 and thought this might be a better plan', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It works. I, too, had issues with getting QB to work. I discovered that Windows 8 has its own anti-virus/malware enabled by default. Once I found out how to disable that, I reinstalled QB, reenabled the protection and QB works with no problem.'}
