{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008RW3XIO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379401200, 'question': 'Visual Studio 2013 is currently in Release Candidate. Is there an upgrade path to 2013 once it is release?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hi Ted, Not sure on this one. In the past there has been upgrade pricing, however I have not seen it on the last release. I think Microsoft is slowly adopting a just pay the price policy. I used to wait and buy the older version when the next one was coming out to just pay the upgrade price, but I think they have caught on! John'}
