{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TNCZNK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355299200, 'question': 'is this good for the life of the computer or redone every year', 'answer': 'You will need to renew it once a year. It keeps track and will notify you when you are coming to the end of the year. It is much cheaper here on Amazon than on their website, as a side note.'}
