{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008TND0PM', 'answerTime': 'Sep 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378882800, 'question': 'Is Norton Antivirus the same for Mac &amp; PC?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Mac does not need any anti-virus. Apple store staff can explain better than I can but the Mac software is not targeted by viruses and spyware/malware. PC's need anti-virus to protect from hacking, viruses, and malware. Norton seems to have worked well for me since I've used it, but I am a very cautious internet user."}
