{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': '20 days ago', 'question': 'I sell on eBay and Amazon, and want something to track my inventory. Also create bar codes I can print out. Can this software do that.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'To create BAR code, you need to go to GS1. This software is for inventory control only.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Apr 29, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430290800, 'question': "I'm about to purchase this, however I need to know if this POS will allow a trade in towards a sale and adjust sales tax for this.", 'answer': 'Hi Raf, thank you for inquiring about CashFootprint. At this time CashFootprint takes trade-ins as a method of payment, and therefore does not offset the subtotal or sales tax collected. If you wanted to reduce the sales tax, you would need to create an item called TRADE or TD and discount it the amount of the value of the trade. This method would lower the subtotal and subsequently the sales tax to be collected. Please let me know if you have any additional questions. I am happy to assist. Kind regards, James'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Apr 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430118000, 'question': 'can I have house charge on this software?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'Hi Parth, thank you for your interest in CashFootprint. At this time CashFootprint will allow store credit; however accounts receivable is not yet complete (where you can collect payments after the initial sale). We expect to complete the AR module this summer. We also offer free software updates so you would receive the update with the AR module at no additional charge when it becomes available.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Apr 18, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429340400, 'question': 'can i use this program on windows 7', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. We actually bought it w/out using it.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425024000, 'question': 'On the screen to pick my server it shows SERVER14096/CASHFOOTPRINT which is different from UTUBE and it also doesnt accept the password.', 'answer': 'Thank you for posting this question. I believe we covered this today via our phone conversation; however, for others who may have this same question, the server name will likely be different as your computer name will not be the same as the computer used in the video. The server will start with your computer name and end with either \\SQLEXPRESS or \\CASHFOOTPRINT depending on if you followed the video exactly. Please feel free to contact us at helpdesk.lothill.com if you have any additional questions. Kind regards, James'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424851200, 'question': 'I would like to try the free trial to see if the program will work with the hardware we already have. How can I try it for free?', 'answer': 'Hi, thank you for your interest in CashFootprint. You can download the free trial by following the instructions in our step-by-step youtube video called "How to Install CashFootprint". Please adhere to the video as there are a few things that need to be adjusted throughout the installations of CashFootprint and the SQL Server Express database software. These are not just Next Next Next installations. Here is the link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_9mFrtnLxQ Kind regards, James'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423296000, 'question': 'Hello, two questions. Will your program work on multiple computers, if so do I have to buy more than one program? Will it work with a touchscreens?', 'answer': 'Hi, thank you for inquiring about CashFootprint Professional. Yes, CashFootprint will allow you to connect multiple terminals together to share data and perform any operations from any terminal in real-time. One license/purchase is require per computer. CashFootprint is also designed to work with touchscreens using our quick sell buttons and an on-screen keyboard. You may Youtube CashFootprint or "LotHill Solutions" for videos. Kind regards, James'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392796800, 'question': 'hi does it com in spanish', 'answer': 'Hello, Thank you for inquiring. At this time CashFootprint is available in English only.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388995200, 'question': 'Hi, can I run this program on a tablet, ie-touchscreen?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Hi Laura, Yes, we are actually getting ready to offer CashFootprint on Dell tablets with Windows 8.1. The software will run in Desktop mode, but as long as you have an 8in tablet or larger you should be in good shape. I recommend you download the software and try it out. Since I cant post links, just Google "lothill download request" and it should be the first link.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008TW6BEU', 'answerTime': 'Jul 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374822000, 'question': 'I am very interested I have a small town business with inventory. I would like more information on this program?', 'answer': 'Hi Vicki, I am more than happy to help you determine if CashFootprint is right for your store. What questions do you have? In general, CashFootprint Professional is a retail point-of-sale software application that will organize your inventory, keep track of your customer history, manage employee access and securely process transactions.'}
