{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008YTAGIK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 28, 2012', 'unixTime': 1356681600, 'question': 'after I install VMWare on my Mac, then I will also need to install Windows OS before I can run/intall a Windows app?', 'answer': 'Yes, you must install an OS (Windows or other) before you can run applications. VMWare just sets up the hardware emulation, it does not include operating systems.'}
