{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0092UELR2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405494000, 'question': 'I am running Mavericks on my iMac. Is this compatible?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes I upgraded to Maverick 10.9 and use Apache all the time with no problems. Easy to convert to other formats if you need to share with people that are using a different platform. I would recommend this for a low end user that needs word processing and spreadsheets without having to pay a fortune for office etc. Of course, there is a learning curve but not much. Acts like and has similar features of excel and word. Hope this helps'}
