{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009348X7Q', 'answerTime': 'Nov 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384848000, 'question': 'Does Dragon Dictate 3.0 favor one headset over another, if so what is the best head set?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'My experience dictates : ) success when using Plantronics DSP-V3. I have used two others with varying success however it may also depend on your voice, diction, inflection, accent, and training the program to understand YOU. Quite honestly I find the Apple voice recognition software included with Mountain Lion and I presume Mavericks to work equally as well as Dragon Dictate. Apple provides far superior customer service. Dragon virtually none! Save a couple hundred bucks with less frustration.'}
