{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0093N1JJG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388736000, 'question': 'Have a student failing algebra 2 and am considering buying this product if it will help...can this program help him with that?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'This program will help a lot, but you have to spend time learning how everything works. Some of the steps explanations are really drawn out and there are easier ways to solve the problems. I personally love the program and my teen uses it too. We both are terrible at math.'}
