{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0099F823E', 'answerTime': 'Nov 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384156800, 'question': 'Does this software crash when used on Windows 7 64 bit?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I bought the Adobe Acrobat XI Standard program when I was running windows 7 Professional (64 bit) and never had an issue with it crashing. I also upgraded to Windows 7 Ultimate (64 bit) and the program continues to work flawlessly. I receive updates from Adobe automatically and the application always runs when I click on the icon and select any of the features I wish to use. I have a Dell Studio XPS 9100 desktop and have never had any problems with the Adobe Acrobat XI Standard software.'}
