{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009APQH76', 'answerTime': 'Jun 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370502000, 'question': "This says 5 devices-so I assume it could just go on PC's alone, is this correct?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "You can use on PC's, Mac's, I-phones, Androids phones, and Tablets. I have it on 2-n PC's, 2- Android phones, and my Galaxy Tablet. You can run any five at one time and even drop one and add another to your list you just can go over five at one time. The pkg. also comes with 20 gigs of free space on Trend Micro Safe-Sync cloud that you can access from anywhere."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009APQH76', 'answerTime': 'Jan 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389513600, 'question': 'Do the 5 devices include cell phone and laptops? Thanks', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, an Android smartphone or tablet is counted as one.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009APQH76', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1357804800, 'question': 'Is it new in a box that was never opened? Is there a disk that comes with it, will it work on vista, and also windows 7 and windos 8. Thanks', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'IT was new in a box with a cd. It runs on windows 8 and windows 7 with no problems. Been a use of Trend Micro for about 5 years.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009APQH76', 'answerTime': 'Oct 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382684400, 'question': 'when you buy the 5 license verison how do you install them on your android phone and samsung tablet?', 'answer': 'Once you install the program on your system (computer) a window will popup and ask if you want to install on your phone and tablet. Say "get started" with another device and it will ask you for your email address to send you a link to install on you phone and tablet. If you have closed that window, on the main screen/ dashboard screen at the very bottom in small letters it says "protect another device" click there follow the directions. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009APQH76', 'answerTime': 'Nov 23, 2012', 'unixTime': 1353657600, 'question': 'HOW LONG IS EACH DEVICES/PC PROTECTED FOR?', 'answer': 'One year (12 months)- Jeff Hendrick'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009APQH76', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379919600, 'question': 'Picture shows "Premium Security" while description states "Maximum Security". The Trend Micro website does not show "Premium" version. Clarification?', 'answer': 'For the 2013 version, Premium and Maximum are the same, with the following exceptions: Premium gives you a 5-user license, while Maximum gives a 3-user license. Premium provides 25BG Online Backup, while Maximum provides 5GB. Everything else is the same.'}
