{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009CCVMM2', 'answerTime': 'Jan 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1357200000, 'question': 'Does this version allows you to do Individual income taxes and also small business? (I have a small candy buffet company)', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Home and Business will work if you are a sole proprietor, consultant, 1099 contractor, or single-owner LLC. You will need to upgrade to Business version if you own an S Corp, partnership, C Corp, or multiple-owner LLC.'}
