{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009ENDZ4C', 'answerTime': 'Feb 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361174400, 'question': 'Is there a no-later-than install date; e.g., can I purchase and install it 6-months later?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'According to telephone support at Symantec, the one year license begins at first installation; if no license from the box is used to install, then all 5 do not expire; so yes, you can purchase it today and install it for the first time six months from now and have a year support from the date of use of the first license; nb: if you use only one license, the other four will still expire at the same time as the one first installed.'}
