{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009ENDZ4C', 'answerTime': 'Dec 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386576000, 'question': 'the norton i bought was a sealed in box cd with a key code when i installed it read retail store activation code needed/,how do i obtain that?', 'answer': 'I have had several Norton Security programs over the last 14 years some bought at stores, some directly from Norton and some from Amazon sellers. The only code I have ever been required to have was the "Key Code". I would suggest that you contact the seller and ask them why you are being asked for a "Store Activation Code". You can also contact Norton Support by by going to..... https://support.norton.com/sp/en/us/home/current/contact-phone.... The form will 1st ask some question but it will then give you a direct phone number to a Norton Support Agent who can help resolve the problem. I have had to use the Norton Support helpline before and have alsways had good results.'}
