{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009ENDZ4C', 'answerTime': 'Feb 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361174400, 'question': 'Am I correct in assuming this can only be downloaded on one of any particular device, for example, one windows pc?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You can protect up to 5 devices. I was able to protect my PC, my Mac, my tablet and my smart phone. It is one year protection from the first device I activated.'}
