{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009FUEQU6', 'answerTime': 'Oct 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382684400, 'question': 'Can you use this software to make night club flyers?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'Only if you want something really artistic, and are willing to spend the time to learn. For a simple flyer this software would probably be overkill, and not the easiest. Word, Wordperfect or search online for "software for making flyers and brochures" to find something free or low cost.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009G6SEKM', 'answerTime': 'Nov 8, 2012', 'unixTime': 1352361600, 'question': 'I recently downloaded the picassa program and was disappointed in it. Do you allow a temporary download for trying out this product? Thanks.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Of course. Try it free for 30-days from here: http://www.adobe.com/downloads/ If you like it, you can purchase from Amazon and simply enter your serial number to activate the trial version.'}
