{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HBCZPQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361692800, 'question': 'I have Microsoft 8 and am unclear about the administrative requirement noted. What does this mean?', 'answer': 'I believe it will run on Windows 8 but you have to run it as administrator. After the program runs and loads you maybe asked if you are the administrator. If not right click on the program start icon, select security, and you can become the program administrator there. In all fairness be advised I have no experience with Windows 8 but do have some programs even on Windows Vista I run in Administer mode.'}
