{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009HBCZPQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361433600, 'question': 'Does the 2012 tax year version, for filing 2012 taxes, also help with preparing 2013 self-employed quarterly tax filings?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'If I understand the question properly, the answer is yes. Based on ones input for 2012 taxes, TurboTax will estimate quarterly payments to the US and state governments for the 2013 tax year, print the government forms and inform you on the dates each quarterly payment is due.'}
