{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HBCH6S', 'answerTime': 'Apr 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1365836400, 'question': "How can I use a gift card to pay for this? I'm not seeing that option when I try to pay.", 'answer': "When I have a gift card, I apply it to my account first and it stores as a credit. Then when you check out, you can use your gift card balance to make the payment. Go to your account, the Payment section and under gift cards select Apply a Gift Card to Your Account. I don't think you can apply a gift care directly to the checkout but I could be wrong."}
