{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HBCU9W', 'answerTime': 'Feb 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1360656000, 'question': 'how many computers can I download this to?', 'answer': 'This is from the Turbo tax/Intuit website: "After you\'ve purchased a downloadable product from turbotax.com, you can re-download it as often as you like for up to 3 years after purchase." Also the following answer from Turbo tax: "The TurboTax End User License Agreement (EULA) for the Basic, Deluxe, Premier, and Home & Business CD/Download versions allows you to install TurboTax on all computers owned by you."'}
