{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HBDID4', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361433600, 'question': 'how do you download an additional state? I need to do taxes in two states - does amazon sell a separate state download or can I do it through turbotax?', 'answer': 'If you enter w-2 for more than one state, turbo tax will highlight the states and indicate which have already been downloaded. You can download the new state by clicking on the download now button. I have not been able to find a way to purchase other states except through the turbo tax download link.'}
