{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HBDID4', 'answerTime': 'Dec 26, 2012', 'unixTime': 1356508800, 'question': 'Does TurboTax handle taxes for trusts, i.e., Form 1041?...how about on the state level?', 'answer': "TurboTax does support entering information from Form 1041 (basically any income reported on Schedules K-1 and Q). It's properly handled income reported to us on Form 1065 at both the Federal and State level. I have no experience with Form 1041, but I suspect it's the same level of support."}
