{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009RHEH24', 'answerTime': 'Jan 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1357027200, 'question': 'I know the platform box PC does not show Win 8 as available, but it does show Win 8 is available as a download. Do you trust the download?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'H & R Block web site http://www.hrblock.com/tax-software/premium.html does not mention supporting Windows 8 on downloads. Look under computer requirements. Probably, they would try to support 8 asap. Call H & R/email them using googled website or just try the download. Comment/Question on this year\'s download software version "last year they promised it ran on Window 7 but it didn\'t......" Worth a double check on 8. The retail package (omitting Windows 8 on its list) may not be able to run 8 so I would try the download version if you just gotta run Windows 8.'}
