{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A3N5W9S', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379919600, 'question': 'I understand Fluenz requires a code that is sent upon purchase or is in the box that allows the purchaser to use the discs. Is the code included ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Rex, Thanks for your question and interest in our Italian program. It sounds like you're asking about the serial number, which is required in order to activate and use the software. We do include this code with your purchase, normally it will come via email shortly after you complete your order. If you don't receive it for whatever reason, just email us at usersupport@fluenz.com and we'll get it sorted out for you, no problem. Hope you enjoy the Fluenz Italian program! Cheers, Jonathan, Fluenz User Support"}
