{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ABAW2UA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425283200, 'question': 'Is this too advanced for a 12 year old', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I think it depends on the 12 year old. All the exercises start off simply enough and get progressively harder. Some of them could prove difficult. However there are so many options in this program that I think you could find enough to start off with and leave the harder stuff for later. You can't start ear training soon enough if you're serious about music so I'd encourage you to purchase it. Their customer support is pretty fantastic as well."}
