{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B5P23SG', 'answerTime': 'Apr 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1367132400, 'question': 'I have some old instructional vhs tapes which may have copyrights. I understand the law allows 1 copy for personal use. Will this program work?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'We have been able to record video tapes of old movies that we have so far with no issues. Version 5 of this product works too if your pc has Windows 7. Make sure your VCR has the red, white, and yellow video/sound ports on the back.'}
