{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BZY0QYA', 'answerTime': 'Oct 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381302000, 'question': 'Why does it tell me I have to be logged in as administrator to setup? How can I fix this?', 'answer': "Alisha,if you're not able to find your administrator sign-in then contact TechJunkies, they'll be able to help you. I had the same trouble and they were able to fix the problem. It all depends on your operating system, Tech Junkies will take care of it."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BZY0QYA', 'answerTime': 'Aug 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377154800, 'question': 'I have the Cricut Expressions 2, version 1.01. Will the SCAL2 work with my machine? I video I watched said that it would but thought I would ask.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I have the Cricut Expression and it works fine. But I think it said on the Sure Cute A Lot web site that they changed the programs where they will not work with newer cricuts. Sorry I hope this helped.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BZY0QYA', 'answerTime': 'Nov 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383811200, 'question': 'I bought the CD for sure cuts a lot 2 with you, did not come over the serial, it comes without it? I like to have the serial? But do not ask me serial', 'answer': "There is no serial number because this is a hacked/stolen version of the software. Legal copies of the software haven't been available since May 2011 as a result of the lawsuit by Provo Craft."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BZY0QYA', 'answerTime': 'Apr 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1365490800, 'question': 'How many downloads are included with this? Will disc be sent?', 'answer': "There is a disc sent to install the software but there aren't any extra downloads included with this listing for the cartridges. However, I get them from www.svgcuts.com and I also make my own images using Adobe Illustrator. I hope this answers your question."}
