{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C139VHC', 'answerTime': 'Aug 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377500400, 'question': 'I have installed the trial version from Autodesk and all I need is the serial number to run the software. If I purchase the download will I have to reinstall the software or can I just enter the serial number.', 'answer': 'Hello - You should be able to enter the serial number into your current installation as long as it is the same product, AutoCAD 2014 LT. For example, an LT license will not work for the full AutoCAD version.'}
