{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00C139VHC', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390291200, 'question': 'I will be using this software on my pc, but later, I would like to reinstall it on my laptop for working on the field. Would that be possible?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Autodesk allows you to install it on two computers - as long as they will not be in use at the same time.'}
