{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C79I0X6', 'answerTime': 'Oct 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382252400, 'question': 'how many computers can i download this program on and how would i do it', 'answer': 'The single user license for this program can legally be installed only on one computer. When I purchased it, I saved the installation program to my computer and then installed rather than click run during the download. That way, I have a copy to reinstall should I need to in the future. With your license code, you should be able to download another copy from Wondershare for backup.'}
