{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CH6AXPW', 'answerTime': 'Aug 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409036400, 'question': 'Is there any benefit to purchasing the download edition of the software for $11 more than the hard copy (CD/DVD) besides not waiting for shipping?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I\'m a tech, so I ALWAYS get a "hard" copy of the software I buy. You never know if something will hiccup and you need to reload your software. It\'s just a preference I have. Also, one of window\'s updates thru my Lightroom 5 into a tizzy. When I open the application now I right-click on the desktop icon and click on "Run as Administrator". It works....just a heads up! Love the program!!!'}
