{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CHZG280', 'answerTime': 'Mar 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426921200, 'question': "I'm looking to create soundtrack style songs, and am looking for a large variety of instrumentals. Which is better for this, Fruity or Producer?", 'answer': 'You can make every type of track with any DAW, it is just a matter of preference, which one you use. If you would like to record your own parts for your track, go for the Producer. The fruity only lets you compose and arrange, no recording. I am a signed producer/remixer and my production is mostly sample-based but every now and then I record guitars, wind intruments, vocals... so the producer version comes in handy.'}
