{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CSJFWUY', 'answerTime': 'Oct 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413442800, 'question': 'Will this work on a windows 8.1 with a quad core processer and 8 gb of RAM', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I currently use Poser 10 on a quad-core, 64bit PC upgraded to Windows 8.1 with 4 GB of ram without issues. Having 8 GB is even better. You shouldn't have any problems installing and running Poser 10 on your PC."}
