{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CY1OE4Q', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427180400, 'question': 'Is there any difference between the student version of LR5 and the standard version of LR5? I am a student but want the full version not some stripped', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I am a photographer and have found zero differences! It's just like how Apple offers their educational pricing on items through the website, same concept for this! Amazing deal!!! :)"}
