{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00D9ACV3W', 'answerTime': 'Mar 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395126000, 'question': 'Can I setup a business email, how many ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "That's a question for your hosting provider. The company you are having your website hosted on. You can go into the control panel for your domain and set up your email accounts. I don't know how many you want/need, but for 99% of the providers, you can do up to 25 email addresses. More might cost extra, check with your hosting providers sales department."}
