{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00E6LIUO2', 'answerTime': 'Aug 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407913200, 'question': 'QB for Accountants 2014.....same exact program I would get if I bought from Intuit?', 'answer': 'Yes. Personally, I bought from Amazon over Intuit directly because I wanted to make sure I got disks, not simply a software download...and it was less expensive. Hope that helps!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00E6LIUO2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404630000, 'question': 'Is this the retail version or the academic version? Is this the version with the CD or the download version? Thank you.', 'answer': 'CD'}
