{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00E6LJAGO', 'answerTime': 'Feb 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393056000, 'question': 'does it work with windows 8 operating system?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, it does work with windows 8. I have Quicken Rental Property Manager running on my PC with w Windows 8.1.'}
