{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00E6LJBUO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411282800, 'question': 'Given the poor performance of this software, what options do users have for preserving their valuable data?', 'answer': "I've been using this software since 1998 (16 years). I'm currently using Quicken Premier 2014 with no issues. I always backup date files weekly to an off line portable storage devise. All upgrades along the way where without problems. Caution, do not backup to a Stick Storage device."}
