{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00E6ONJJU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393488000, 'question': "as know im on my own, I don't know which Anti virus to get for beginners, will this be pretty easy for me?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'If you want help with your computer, go to your nearest Staples, Best Buy or Office Depot and have them install something. If you are comfortable installing your own software, Kaspersky is a good choice. Not the only choice on the market but it will protect and survive most computer attacks.'}
