{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00E7X9RUK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386230400, 'question': 'Has Quicken Deluxe 2014 improved with R4? Did you install with the CD or Amazon download? Thank you.', 'answer': 'For me it was a great improvement since I upgraded from 2009. I especially like the fact that my information is only one file now. I did the Amazon download. Hope this helps.'}
