{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00E7X9RUK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395730800, 'question': "haven't up dated for many years, currently using XP, which after April 8, no support.......would it be better to wait to update Quicken after I may have to get new computor?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Chancey: The only advice I can give you is that my old PC was dying, and I waited until I got my new one before downloading the updated Quicken. I was afraid if I loaded it to my old PC, it would totally crash. So that's what I would advise, but I'm definitely not an expert."}
