{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EDQ7J1U', 'answerTime': 'Aug 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409209200, 'question': 'Will Power2Go 9 Platinum convert videos from YouTube to videos that can be played on any standard video player?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Leo, Yes it will make your DVD, under one condition !! The downloaded Youtube videos has to be 1080p resolution, 720p you are in the extreme margin to have a relatively good film without any interruptions... Lower than 720p, FORGET IT !! Take it from me, I've tried.... ( 480p - Very irregular and halts alot.. / 720p - More or less good DVD video, last 1080p Resolution EXCELLENT for DVD videos... WARNING ! 1080p files are large, don't be surprised when you see sizes of ( 1 or 2 GB )...... I hope this helps........ !"}
