{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ENFYLN0', 'answerTime': 'Apr 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397372400, 'question': "What's the term of the updates (1 yr? 2 yr?) and afterwards, how much does it cost to renew?", 'answer': "Hi Inspector, I have been using Trend Micro for six years and I'm very happy with it. The subscription is for one year. During that time, you will receive daily updates of the virus definitions to keep your software as up-to-date as possible. Renewal for the package I have is $59.99 per year."}
