{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EOGGDXO', 'answerTime': 'May 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401346800, 'question': 'which is the best internet security system?', 'answer': "If your looking for overall total security then this Bitedefender total is for you! I have used it on 2 laptops now one with Windows 7 and the other with Windows 8. I am very happy with all of the features that they offer, and it's superior antivirus protection. To top it off this is a 2 year protection plan, it updates so your not buying another new program next year!!! I bought this to replace Kaspersky, and within hours I was impressed at the amount of viruses , Trojans, and malware that Bitedefender removed. And it doesn't slow your computer or laptop down like Norton 360 did to mine. Overall I give this a 10 out of 10 stars and will only purchase Bitedefender products. FYI, if your replacing a Norton product please download the Norton removal tool found online. No matter the choice of new product, it will not install and operate correctly unless Norton is 100% removed! Good luck!"}
