{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EPACO3M', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425542400, 'question': 'Do this software auto add holidays to calendars or do you have to infut in each cell?', 'answer': "We have made cards for Thank You, Sympathy, Get Well, Weddings, and Anniversaries and find the graphics files large and extensive. There a lot of categories and you should be able to find what you want. Plus you can import your own photos and graphics. We haven't made an actual calendar."}
