{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EPACO3M', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425024000, 'question': 'Does it make newsletters?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes it has a project for Newsletters, calendars, cards, and many more.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EPACO3M', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424505600, 'question': 'I wish it would list all that you can make with it. Does it flyers, newsletters, or create letterheads? Any business type forms that I can create?', 'answer': "I've used it to make posters, but it has the ability to also make letterhead and newsletters - and most other stationery needs. It took some getting used to before I could effectively work with the text - practice makes perfect. I like Print Artist but I do not use it as much as Hallmark."}
