{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EXPSVJK', 'answerTime': 'Jun 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402124400, 'question': 'Is there a manual to show how to use printshop 3.5 with Windows 8?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No, there isn\'t anything extra. There\'s just the regular User\'s guide which you will find hidden under the "help" button in the upper part of the screen (on the right side). This user\'s guide is separated for version 3.0 and 3.5, same appears to the video tutorials which you can find there, too. But the software seems to being directed to Win 8 users. For me, using still XP it\'s too complicated to use, so usually I prefer to work with my Print shop 21 instead. Best regards, Heinz'}
