{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EZKNY8G', 'answerTime': 'Apr 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398841200, 'question': "what if I don't want my files backed up to the cloud????", 'answer': "Hi Jack, Backing up to the cloud is an optional feature and is not turned on by default. If you don't want to back up to the cloud then do nothing after installing Webroot. If you do want to back up to the cloud at a later stage you'll have to turn on this feature manually. Regards, Darren"}
