{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EZPXVWU', 'answerTime': 'Aug 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408086000, 'question': "What's the difference between the 2 types of packages? One ordering package list just the OS's and the other list OS's CODE?", 'answer': 'The regular package ships with an installation cd. If the one you buy says OS Code, you only receive the product license key and then you will have to download the software over the internet (no additional charge). The end result is the same, in most customers situations, it just a matter of preference.'}
