{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00F8K9L66', 'answerTime': 'Dec 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386403200, 'question': 'how many efiles come with this and what if I need more?', 'answer': 'You can e-file up to 5 federal returns which is the IRS limit for e-file. The federal e-file is free. You can e-file up to 3 state returns per federal return. The state e-file is not free. You can print and mail your state return for free, or you can pay for the e-file ($19.99 per e-file). You can print and mail as many federal or state returns as you want for free, there is no limit. Only one free state-package is included, though, which you select to download when you install/get to the state part. If you are in the situation you need to file a return in more than one state, it will cost $39.99 per extra state (in addition to the optional e-file cost).'}
