{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00F8K9N32', 'answerTime': 'Jan 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388908800, 'question': 'Does TurboTax Business Fed and Efile 2013 include the Form 1040. The Turbo Tax website lists the 1040 form under forms for Turbo Tax Business Fed?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Form 1040 is for personal taxes, this software is for corporations. If you have a self employed business, the form you need to file for the business part is Schedule C that is embedded in 1040. So you need Turbotax Home and Business.'}
