{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00F8LJ5DY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411542000, 'question': 'How many audio tracks are avail..can you independantly fade the individual audio tracks selected ? i', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes you can. There's a few setting for what you're wanting. You select the track and right click and select fade in or out. Or costume fade points. I haven't done those yet because I haven't had the need to, but yes you can. Go on YouTube to lean more before you get disappointed on spending your money and didn't get what you thought it was. Note this program take a high in computer, please have a I7 for the best result. Also once you buy the download you CAN'T GET YOUR MONEY BACK. It's a Amazon thing. Well I hope this helps and thank you for reading."}
