{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FFZY17I', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418198400, 'question': 'Is there a drum generator or anything of the sort? Something that allows me to create a drum loop without having to actually record my kit?', 'answer': 'Yes there are midi drum kits with the program as well as a drum generator. If you are familiar with the midi process and how to record in midi you can create loops with any of the available kits on the program. You will also have use the piano roll in the midi edit tab of the docker to create your loops. Most of the instructions are in the PDF manual that comes with the program. There are also youtube videos on how to create midi drum loops. Hope this helps.'}
