{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00FJIBVE2', 'answerTime': '8 days ago', 'question': 'Is there a way to improve print quality with Printshop 3.5? Lines are fuzzy regardless of font used.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "You know, I have noticed the same thing. I haven't tried to make my less fuzzy, I just re-type whatever I'm doing into my new Printshop. Or I use Notepad or Word. I think I still have 1 that I use, but plan to reprint it as soon as I have the time. Sorry I can't help you on this. Seems like there should be a way, but I even tried different fonts and it didn't change the fuzziness. Charlene"}
