{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FZ0FETC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392278400, 'question': 'I have the HP2000, IPhone, &amp; table Samsung so I would need the 3 device, right???? which product would I buy for the best result and to be safe and all???', 'answer': "I wish I could give you a super answer, BUT the best I answer I can saw is ask their support service to make sure!!! Wit the different devices you've listed. Check with them direct! Here's a link to their contact page: http://www.webroot.com/us/en/company/contact-us"}
