{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00FZ0FK0U', 'answerTime': 'Sep 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410505200, 'question': 'If I already have webroot installed (expires in 10 days) can I download this version Webroot wants 79.00 for the renewal.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, you definitely can. I had the same confusion actually. All you have to do is purchase the product on Newegg. After you have the program security key, open your Webroot secure anywhere software and click on the small gear next to "my account." You can then copy and paste your code into the activate new keycode field. All set.'}
