{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00G6E60X0', 'answerTime': 'May 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400050800, 'question': "I got the trial and would like to buy this software. It says it's for windows 8. I have vista and the trial version worked. Will this boxed version work on vista.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'From the back of the DxO Optics Pro 9 box sitting in front of me: Minimum configuration required Microsoft Windows Vista (32, 64 bits), Windows 7 (32, 64 bits), Windows 8 (32, 64 bits) Intel Core 2 Duo or Higher, AMD Athlon 64 X2 or higher processor, 2GB RAM ----- Mac OS X 10.6, 10.7, 10.8, 10.9 64 bits systems only, Mac with Intel processor, 2GB RAM'}
