{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00GWH3C0A', 'answerTime': 'Feb 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391500800, 'question': 'How many users/seats is this for?', 'answer': "On Amazon you can not purchase volume licenses...so these are all single user copies. You'll need to contact an authorized FileMaker Business Alliance member to purchase discounted licenses for more that 5 users. See the following explanation http://cimbura.com/tech/2013/10/18/filemaker-licensing-made-easy/"}
