{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00H09BOXQ', 'answerTime': 'May 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399618800, 'question': "Doe's Windows Pro support 32GB of ram?", 'answer': 'Yes. Professional, Enterprise, and Ultimate support up to 192GB of ram. Home Premium onlys allow 16GB max. After that, it now all depends on how much memory your processor and motherboard can support.'}
