{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00HRQB216', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418803200, 'question': 'Can this render to 720p or 1080p with AAC audio at 320 CBR or VBR?', 'answer': 'Of course. However I cannot find AAC with VBR. If there are settings for that somewhere, there are hidden. There is AAC with CBR of course, all bitrates up to 512 kbps, at standard 48000hz.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00HRQB216', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418803200, 'question': 'Can this render to AAC audio at 320 CBR or VBR and 720p or 1080p video?', 'answer': "This is a little over my head but tried to find this out for you. There are long lists of possible render modes I do see on the list `Main Concept AVC/AAC' I also see `Fraunhofer AAC' I tried to include a screen shot of the Templates list for each when they are highlighted - but I guess this medium of interaction does not allow these. I dont' think the `Fraunhofer AAC' thing is anything you are looking for but there is a long list of items under the templates side when `Main Concept AVC/AAC' is highlighted - I don't have the time to copy by hand the whole list - if you could send me an e-mail directly I could screen shot you the list. But it seems like the list likely contains the parameters/features you were looking for. you may write me directly if this amazon sites allows it. david.blake@unitypoint.org Dave"}
