{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00HUUBNT0', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411455600, 'question': 'Do I need Word on my computer to use this?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You print the document from the program, no need for Word. Use a parchment paper and it really looks good.'}
