{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00HV03LA8', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403679600, 'question': 'I need to create 3 sets of docs. I assume that this software will allow that if the files are saved in different names. Is my assumption correct?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The will documents allow you to save in different names, the online trust can only be used once.'}
