{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00HX0TSSA', 'answerTime': 'Apr 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397545200, 'question': 'I plan to purchase a new pc with 8.1. Will I be able to use this?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You certainly can. I am currently using the 3 license version, and have not had a problem. I have used Norton products for over 20 years rather than some other well known brands. Besides, some of the other brands will bug the C%$# out of you.'}
