{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ICPW2HO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410591600, 'question': 'Is the software download limited to once only one hardware? I have 2 desktop and 2 laptop in my house alone.Or can I creat a backup disc .', 'answer': "It's software that you own and can download onto all of your computers. All you have to do is access your account on amazon and download as many times as you want as long as it is onto your computers for your own personal use."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ICPW2HO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405580400, 'question': 'Does this download include only the applicable software? In other words, there are no additional programs to get into my hard drive? Thanks.', 'answer': "Oh, no. There are no piggybacks. I would like to take this opportunity to assure you that there are check boxes that you need to be careful for when installing or updating. I can't tell you the times that I had to retry an update because there were three things being installed instead of just the one. I had two boxes to uncheck. I wish I could know what file extensions you were converting. I only used this to convert from one type and could find no use after that."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ICPW2HO', 'answerTime': 'Jan 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422345600, 'question': 'Will this software join &amp; convert multiple VOB files to a single MP4 Mpeg format for Youtube DVD etc.........', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I can\'t say. My problem was the program did not work, with my computer OS (Windows 7). I was attempting to convert mp4(s) files to mp3 files. The downloaded program could not "see" the files in the folder. The download provider did try to correct the problem but after two attempts with no change in the program\'s ability to acquire the files, I felt I had been patient enough. They company representing the download called and asked for permission to control my computer, so that they might be able to fix the problem. I did not feel comfortable allowing someone that I did not know that kind of access to my computer.'}
