{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00IVFDZBC', 'answerTime': 'Jan 28, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422432000, 'question': 'Is this Original Product...which has unique and valid licence?????', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Not quite sure what you mean by this. However, if you are asking if it is genuine YOURS solely when you purchase AND it has a unique licence number in the box, then the answer is yes to all. It is utterly excellent and comes with my very highest recommendation. I've been using previous versions of the software for years, but this is definitly a major step forward. Not cheap, but worth every penny."}
