{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00JC5Y744', 'answerTime': 'Jul 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405666800, 'question': 'does it work with MS Windows 7, and does it read Word and can be seen by Word users in emais?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, it does work well with Windows &. RE emails, I never send emails as WordPerfect or Word files. There are plenty who can't read MS Word. Here in Australia, unfortunately very few use WordPerfect. If I am sending files as email attachments, I always save them as PDF files which you can do very easily in WordPerfect. I hope this helps. Pat Flanagan"}
